            <div class="col-lg-7">
              <div class="impact-content">
                <h3 class="mb-3">Office of the Deputy Rector (Academics)</h3>

                <p>The Office of the Deputy Rector (Academics) typically oversees academic affairs and ensures the
                  smooth operation of academic programs.This office is responsible for implementing policies related to
                  teaching, research, curriculum development, and academic staff matters.</p>

                <p>The Deputy Rector (Academics) coordinates academic planning, quality assurance, and the overall
                  academic calendar, working closely with heads of departments, faculty members, and students to
                  maintain academic standards and promote innovation in teaching and learning.</p>
                <div class="impact-buttons">
                  <a href="/mission-vision-objectives" class="btn-donate">Our Vision</a>
